313
00:11:09,069 --> 00:11:12,449
Large AI model companies must conduct comprehensive safety tests.

314
00:11:12,449 --> 00:11:13,989
They must report any risks.

315
00:11:13,989 --> 00:11:16,200
and if any problems do arise, they must be held accountable.

316
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:20,220
At the time, pretty much every AI company was against this bill—OpenAI, Google...

317
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:23,179
Google, Meta, and Y Combinator were all against it.

318
