321
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:30,000
This is from a letter that Dalio wrote to California Governor Newsom.

322
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,080
Conditional support.

323
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:33,200
We believe that the revised SB 1047

324
