00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:52,560
He said this is the cleanest execution of the 'safety oil' playbook yet.

332
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,840
With 99% of its costs—say, a hundred million dollars—tied up in training, Anthropic knows its greatest strength is its compliance.

333
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,460
And that's why they support regulation.

334
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:58,700
Regulation will weed out competitors with weaker compliance.

335
00:11:58,700 --> 00:12:00,240
