336
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,880
There's one piece of data we can all take a look at.

337
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:04,540
So, this bill primarily affects the large model companies.

338
00:12:04,540 --> 00:12:08,210
To be specific, it's defined as models with training costs exceeding 100 million US dollars.

339
00:12:08,210 --> 00:12:10,210
For small and medium-sized AI companies, this line puts Anthropic,

340
00:12:10,210 --> 00:12:11,290
