344
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,840
So, how do the big companies stack up against each other?

345
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:24,720
Anthropic has the most comprehensive compliance system, so if this bill becomes law...

346
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,600
Anthropic would be the least affected.

347
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:29,590
So, you can really get a sense of the competitive dynamics at play here.

348
00:12:29,590 --> 00:12:32,810
Fifth, they use contract clauses to shut out their competitors.

349
00:12:32,810 --> 00:12:35,089
This all kicks off in June 2025.

