391
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:07,640
So, if all five of these moves are about shutting competitors out,

392
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:10,600
And the sixth thing is to shut everyone else out.

393
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,800
On the evening of May 11th,

394
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:13,260
Anthropic announced on its official website that...

395
00:14:13,260 --> 00:14:15,920
any equity interests that have not been approved by the board of directors,

396
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:18,550
stock sales and transfers, are void and of no effect.

397
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:20,950
and will not be recorded in our books.

398
00:14:20,950 --> 00:14:22,430
The word is 'void'.

399
00:14:22,430 --> 00:14:23,430
In English, it's 'void'.

400
00:14:23,430 --> 00:14:24,670
Not voidable.

401
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:26,550
Void means it's inherently invalid from the very beginning.

402
00:14:26,550 --> 00:14:28,790
Voidable means it can be revoked.

403
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:31,930
And there's a huge legal difference between the two terms.

404
00:14:31,930 --> 00:14:33,410
The term 'void' under Delaware's corporate law in the United States...

405
00:14:33,410 --> 00:14:36,010
The meaning in Delaware's corporate law is very strict.

406
00:14:36,010 --> 00:14:39,089
It means the transaction was void from the very beginning.

407
00:14:39,089 --> 00:14:41,549
The buyers have no legal protection whatsoever.

408
00:14:41,549 --> 00:14:43,120
They have absolutely no recourse.

