483
00:17:17,250 --> 00:17:18,890
A century ago, logistics was the bottleneck.

484
00:17:18,890 --> 00:17:21,130
Today, the law is the bottleneck.

485
00:17:21,130 --> 00:17:22,440
The tools have changed, but the logic is the same.

